# Token claim sets for the cel-id-roles identity case.
# The presence of this file marks the case as an IDENTITY case: suite.sh mints
# one token per key via the mock's POST /generate (body = the JSON below),
# attaches it as `Authorization: Bearer`, and fires GET /toys.
# Only custom claims are set here (roles). iss/aud/sub come from the mock's env
# so there are no duplicate keys (overriding a default claim would duplicate it).
# Format: <token-key> <claims-json>
admin {"roles":["admin"]}
guest {"roles":["guest"]}
